sequenceDiagram
participant WI as Work Item
participant CL as Classification
participant T as Deadline / Time
participant RM as Reminder Engine
participant DB as PostgreSQL
participant MQ as Broker
participant NT as Notification
participant P as Provider
actor User
WI->>CL: Classification context
WI->>T: Temporal context
CL->>RM: Importance / urgency / nature
T->>RM: Deadlines / planned start
RM->>RM: Resolve policy hierarchy
RM->>DB: Store plan + reminder instances
RM->>MQ: Async reminder work
MQ->>NT: NotificationRequest
NT->>NT: Preferences + policy + deduplication
NT->>P: Deliver
P-->>NT: Provider result
NT->>DB: Delivery status
P-->>User: Notification
Note over RM,NT: Reminder decides WHEN; Notification decides HOW.
